ISO-10303-21;
/* Gp066 - ShapeFix_Edge.FixSameParameter selection-bias tolerance comparison
 * Defect: FixSameParameter chooses first candidate tolerance exceeding Precision::Confusion
 * instead of picking the minimum feasible tolerance. Creates edge with suboptimal fit. */
